console.js.synd.mcp.claude_prompt:
Set up Claire Bible on this computer. Run these commands in order, one at a time, and tell me each result.
1) claude plugin install claire --marketplace {repo}
2) claude mcp add --transport http --scope user claire {mcp_url}
3) claude mcp login claire
If a step says that it is already done, continue with the next step. If the claude command is not found, stop and tell me. Do not change other settings. At the end, tell me to restart Claude.
